SecWeekly Digest #412 - your Friday summary of security news.

Lead story: patch management at scale.
A survey of 300 IT teams found that most apply critical updates within two weeks, but firmware and network devices lag months behind. The report recommends an asset inventory and a monthly maintenance window.

Also this week: a review of hardware security keys, and five questions to ask a managed detection provider.

